{'symbol': 'PLD', 'date': '2023-05-04 17:27:00', 'title': 'PROLOGIS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS AND ANNOUNCES RESULTS FROM STOCKHOLDER MEETING', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF PROLOGIS, INC. (NYSE: PLD) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR CASH DIVIDEND FOR THE QUARTER ENDING JUNE 30, 2023 ON THE FOLLOWING SECURITIES: A DIVIDEND OF $0.87 PER SHARE OF THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON JUNE 30, 2023, TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 16, 2023; AND A DIVIDEND OF $1.0675 PER SHARE OF THE COMPANY'S 8.54% SERIES Q CUMULATIVE REDEEMABLE PREFERRED STOCK, PAYABLE ON JUNE 30, 2023, TO SERIES Q STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 16, 2023. ANNUAL MEETING RESULTS THE FOLLOWING PROPOSALS WERE APPROVED AT THE COMPANY'S 2023 ANNUAL STOCKHOLDER MEETING: OUR STOCKHOLDERS ELECTED HAMID R."}